From: Domenico D'Arrigo <DCHEM88@hotmail.it>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:11:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] UefiPayloadPkg/SmmStoreLib: Let the caller end the whole
 flash access

coreboot grants the *AnyBlock commands, which reach the whole flash, to
a boot that starts with update capsules, until the next boot; since it
can't enforce it, the payload must reset before anything else runs.
coreboot now lets the payload give that access up instead, with the
command that enables it and a zero argument.

Add SmmStoreLibEndAnyBlockAccess() for it, so that a boot that ends up
writing nothing to the flash can go on without a reset.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018n3yuWwDLW63F4vdf7ZFTv
---
 UefiPayloadPkg/Include/Library/SmmStoreLib.h  | 15 +++++++++++
 UefiPayloadPkg/Library/SmmStoreLib/SmmStore.c | 25 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 40 insertions(+)

diff --git a/UefiPayloadPkg/Include/Library/SmmStoreLib.h b/UefiPayloadPkg/Include/Library/SmmStoreLib.h
index 282823f2fb..950ecf826f 100644
--- a/UefiPayloadPkg/Include/Library/SmmStoreLib.h
+++ b/UefiPayloadPkg/Include/Library/SmmStoreLib.h
@@ -145,6 +145,21 @@ SmmStoreLibEraseAnyBlock (
   IN         EFI_LBA  Lba
   );
 
+/**
+  Give up the access to the whole flash until the next boot.  The firmware
+  grants it to a boot that starts with update capsules; without it, the
+  *AnyBlock functions fail.
+
+  @retval EFI_SUCCESS     The whole flash is no longer accessible.
+  @retval EFI_NO_MEDIA    SmmStore is not initialized.
+  @retval others          The handler refused: it may still be accessible.
+
+**/
+EFI_STATUS
+SmmStoreLibEndAnyBlockAccess (
+  VOID
+  );
+
 /**
   Function to update a pointer on virtual address change.  Matches the signature
   and operation of EfiConvertPointer.
diff --git a/UefiPayloadPkg/Library/SmmStoreLib/SmmStore.c b/UefiPayloadPkg/Library/SmmStoreLib/SmmStore.c
index a5754a4d5c..875b7269b6 100644
--- a/UefiPayloadPkg/Library/SmmStoreLib/SmmStore.c
+++ b/UefiPayloadPkg/Library/SmmStoreLib/SmmStore.c
@@ -383,6 +383,31 @@ SmmStoreLibEraseAnyBlock (
            );
 }
 
+/**
+  Give up the access to the whole flash until the next boot.  The firmware
+  grants it to a boot that starts with update capsules; without it, the
+  *AnyBlock functions fail.
+
+  @retval EFI_SUCCESS     The whole flash is no longer accessible.
+  @retval EFI_NO_MEDIA    SmmStore is not initialized.
+  @retval others          The handler refused: it may still be accessible.
+
+**/
+EFI_STATUS
+SmmStoreLibEndAnyBlockAccess (
+  VOID
+  )
+{
+  if (mSmmStoreInfo == NULL) {
+    return EFI_NO_MEDIA;
+  }
+
+  //
+  // The argument is the requested state, not a pointer: zero disables.
+  //
+  return CallSmm (mSmmStoreInfo->ApmCmd, SMMSTORE_CMD_USE_FULL_FLASH, 0);
+}
+
 /**
   Fixup internal data so that EFI can be called in virtual mode.
   Converts any pointers in lib to virtual mode. This function is meant to
